{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/仁心绽放","pageid":9101,"revid":22254,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BB%81%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%BD%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BB%81%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%BD%E6%94%BE&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BB%81%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%BD%E6%94%BE&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>仁心绽放</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.BB.81.E5.BF.83.E7.BB.BD.E6.94.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"仁心绽放\"><b>仁心绽放</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 仁心绽放.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/12/295k7x6vi6jocd6lyupy1lfgkmsda4r.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BB%81%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%BD%E6%94%BE.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/12/295k7x6vi6jocd6lyupy1lfgkmsda4r.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BB%81%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%BD%E6%94%BE.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/12/295k7x6vi6jocd6lyupy1lfgkmsda4r.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />仁心绽放\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，对目标地形格范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有己方进行治疗，治疗量为魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：最大生命值和受到治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>。释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"真爱世人之光\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">真爱世人之光</font></span></span>]时，使其范围内其他友军额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-4 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"242\" data-file-height=\"245\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8D%A1%E4%B8%BD%E4%B8%9D%E2%80%A2%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/卡丽丝•庇护之誓\"><img alt=\"头像 卡丽丝•庇护之誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/ax9hkbxkda6n